<section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><div><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>08</span>STRAIGHT ANSWERS</p><h2>Frequently asked questions about our B2B data</h2><p>Straight answers. If yours isn&#x27;t here, email us or message us on Slack. A human replies.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@cleanrowsdata.com">Ask a human by email <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></a></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Where does the data actually come from?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Public B2B sources: LinkedIn, company websites, public directories and public regulatory filings. We don&#x27;t buy or resell private databases. Lists include LinkedIn profiles, company context and contact details. Business emails go through two verification tools before delivery.</p></details><details><summary>How should we handle privacy and outreach permissions?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Tell us your target markets and any exclusions before we build your list. Your team is responsible for deciding how to use prospect data under applicable privacy laws and each platform’s rules. We can exclude EU prospects on request. We do not provide legal advice.</p></details><details><summary>Can I order a list for LinkedIn prospecting?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. Tell us the job titles, seniority, industries, company sizes and locations in your ICP. LinkedIn profile URLs and company details help your team research prospects, plan account-based campaigns and personalise outreach. Share your intended workflow so we can agree the fields before building your sample.</p></details><details><summary>Can you find genuinely niche ICPs?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Usually. Send us the exact titles, industry, company size and location, however narrow. If we can&#x27;t build it properly, we&#x27;ll say so before you pay, rather than shipping you a padded list.</p></details><details><summary>How fast is delivery, really?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>1,000 leads in about 3 hours. 10,000 in 24 hours. 50,000 in 48 hours. 100,000+ takes 5–7 business days. Need it faster? Ask, we&#x27;ll tell you honestly whether it&#x27;s possible.</p></details><details><summary>Do all leads come with a mobile number?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No, and anyone promising 100% is guessing. We find publicly available mobiles for roughly 50–60% of rows. The delivered file marks clearly which rows have one, so you&#x27;re never paying for a blank column.</p></details><details><summary>Why don&#x27;t you offer tech-stack data?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>We tried it and weren&#x27;t satisfied with the accuracy available. Shipping a &quot;uses HubSpot&quot; column that&#x27;s wrong 30% of the time is worse than not shipping it, you&#x27;d write campaigns on it. We&#x27;ll add it when we can stand behind it.</p></details><details><summary>What format do I get, and can I get custom columns?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Google Sheet or CSV, your choice. Standard columns: First Name, Last Name, Title, Company, Domain, Email, Mobile, HQ Phone, Personal LinkedIn URL, Company LinkedIn URL, Company Size, Industry, Location. Per-client file splits are available on request. We confirm any additional research, custom fields and associated pricing before you order.</p></details><details><summary>What if the list doesn&#x27;t match what I asked for?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>We rebuild it free or refund you, your call. That&#x27;s also exactly why the free 100-lead sample exists: you check fit before any money changes hands.</p></details><details><summary>Can I set up recurring monthly delivery?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. Tell us your monthly volume, targeting and delivery schedule. We agree the scope and price before you order. Volumes of 100,000 or more receive a custom quote. There is no automatic renewal.</p></details><details><summary>Which markets can you build lists for?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Tell us the countries or regions in your ICP. We can research names and companies in most countries, and your free sample shows the coverage before you pay. The file is delivered in English-language format.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a contract or minimum?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>There is no subscription or automatic renewal. Paid packages start at 1,000 leads for $25, and your first 100-lead sample is free. Larger or specialist requirements receive a custom quote before you pay.</p></details></div><div class="section-cta"><p>Still deciding if we can build your audience? <strong>Check with a free sample.</strong></p><div class="cta-pair"><a class="button lime cta-primary" data-sample href="#contact">Get 100 free leads</a><a class="button cta-secondary" href="#pricing">Choose a plan</a></div></div></section>